 "lab": {
  "title": "IPv6: адресация и маршрутизация",
  "text": "Компьютерам уже назначены IPv6-адреса: PC1 2001:db8:1::10/64, PC2 2001:db8:2::10/64.\n\n1. Включите на **R1** маршрутизацию IPv6 (`ipv6 unicast-routing`).\n2. Назначьте Gi0/0 адрес 2001:db8:1::1/64, Gi0/1 адрес 2001:db8:2::1/64 и включите интерфейсы.\n3. Проверьте `ping 2001:db8:2::10` и `tracert -6` с PC1.",
  "checks": [
   "ip R1 2001:db8:1::1 | Адрес Gi0/0",
   "ip R1 2001:db8:2::1 | Адрес Gi0/1",
   "ping PC1 2001:db8:2::10 | PC1 видит PC2 по IPv6"
  ],
  "translations": {
   "en": {
    "title": "IPv6: addressing and routing",
    "text": "The computers already have IPv6 addresses: PC1 2001:db8:1::10/64, PC2 2001:db8:2::10/64.\n\n1. Enable IPv6 routing on **R1** (`ipv6 unicast-routing`).\n2. Give Gi0/0 the address 2001:db8:1::1/64 and Gi0/1 2001:db8:2::1/64, and enable the interfaces.\n3. Check `ping 2001:db8:2::10` and `tracert -6` from PC1.",
    "checks": [
     "Gi0/0 address",
     "Gi0/1 address",
     "PC1 reaches PC2 over IPv6"
    ]
   }
  },
  "script": {
   "R1": "enable\nconfigure terminal\nipv6 unicast-routing\ninterface gi0/0\nipv6 address 2001:db8:1::1/64\nno shutdown\ninterface gi0/1\nipv6 address 2001:db8:2::1/64\nno shutdown\nend"
  }
 }
}